OL,8,     Fgives it his all.
OL,9,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,10,     FPhillip is dizzy and
OL,11,     Fdisorientated, and his GP suspects
OL,12,     Fan amnesiac disorder. Already on
OL,13,     Fanti-anxiety meds, Karen may have
OL,14,     FPTSD, so is referred for
OL,15,     Fpsychiatric assessment.
